1 0 0 1 56.00 726.00 Tm /F2 19.00 Tf (Curb - Data Retention and Disposal Policy) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 693.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Version 1.3) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 679.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Effective date: October 24, 2026) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 665.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Owner: Founder and sole operator, Curb) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 651.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Contact: support.curb@tkhub.app) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 637.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Applies to: the Curb mobile application \(iOS and Android\) and the Curb backend service) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 606.50 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (1. Purpose and scope) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 580.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Curb is a rideshare and food delivery application. This policy defines what personal data Curb collects, where it) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 566.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (is held, how long it is kept, how it is destroyed, and how a consumer can have it deleted. It covers all data held) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 552.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (by Curb, including data obtained through a legacy Plaid bank link, and it binds every system Curb operates.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 530.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (This policy is enforced through the design of the product itself. The retention limits described below are) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 516.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (implemented in Curb's code and in the configuration of its processors, not left to manual discretion.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 485.80 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (2. Data classification) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 459.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Curb classifies the data it handles into three tiers.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 437.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Tier 1 - Sensitive financial data. Bank account and routing numbers, full card numbers, card security codes,) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 423.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Plaid access tokens, government identifiers. Curb no longer accepts typed-in bank account or routing numbers.) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 409.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Older driver records may still hold a hand-typed account entered before that change; it is deleted when the) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 395.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (driver removes it or deletes their account, and it must be purged before payouts go live.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 381.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Tier 2 - Personal data. Pickup and dropoff locations for an active job, masked payout account details, payment) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 367.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (method references, driver email addresses, trip and payout records.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 353.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Tier 3 - Non-personal data. App settings, saved place labels, fare configuration, and other data that is not tied) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 339.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (to an identified person.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 309.10 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (3. Where data is held) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 282.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- On the user's own device. Saved places, driver documents, ratings and app settings are stored in the app's) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 268.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (local storage on the device.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 254.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Curb's backend. Operated on Cloudflare Workers and Durable Objects, hosted in the United States. Records) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 240.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (are keyed to the user's Curb account. An account is opened by signing in with an email code, a phone code,) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 226.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Apple or Google. Curb holds the sign-in email address or phone number, a verified order contact number, ride) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 212.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (and payment records, and any rental or storage listing a user publishes, including its photos. Curb does not) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 198.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (hold advertising identifiers.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 184.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Processors. Stripe \(card processing and driver payouts\), Plaid \(a legacy bank link kept only for drivers who) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 170.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (linked before Stripe payouts; no new links are made\), Resend \(transactional email\), Twilio \(phone sign-in) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 156.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (codes, masked recorded calls, and one text to a passenger someone else booked for\), and Checkr \(driver) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 142.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (background checks on Checkr's own page\). Each acts only on Curb's documented instructions. The in-app) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 128.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (assistant forwards a message or a photo to TK Engine and Curb does not store that message or photo.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 98.10 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (4. Data Curb explicitly does not store) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 71.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (The following are never written to Curb's storage, logs, backups, or analytics, in production or in any test) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 57.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (environment:) Tj
ET
endstream
