1 0 0 1 62.11 708.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Curb receives only an opaque Stripe reference plus the card brand and last four digits.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 694.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Bank login credentials of any kind. Payout bank details are entered with Stripe.) Tj
