1 0 0 1 62.11 666.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (on Checkr's hosted page. Curb does not receive them and does not store them.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 635.50 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (5. Retention schedule) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 609.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Data is retained only as long as it serves the purpose it was collected for.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 587.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Driver location during a live trip: latitude and longitude, and from an iPhone the phone's battery level, kept on) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 573.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (that trip as the latest point and a trail of up to 240 points. New points are accepted only while the trip is) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 559.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (accepted, arrived, or under way. The trip record, including that trail, is dropped from the dispatch board two) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 545.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (hours after its last update. It is not kept as a long-term location history.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 531.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- A rider's background location reading for a booked ride: read on the phone and not uploaded.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 517.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Safety-share location: the phone's position while a share is open. The share expires after six hours. Stopping) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 503.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (it deletes the share about thirty minutes later.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 489.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Masked-call recordings: kept 30 days, or 180 days if the call was reported, then deleted.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 475.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Crash and launch reports: kept 30 days, and only after the person turns usage sharing on. A report has no) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 461.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (name, email, phone, address, or coordinates.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 447.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Curb Kids child details \(first name, last initial, age, seat, note, receiving adult\): kept on the parent's phone until) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 433.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (the parent deletes the child. Curb's servers do not store them. The school calendar and an adult driver or) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 419.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (companion certification are kept until the adult deletes the account or asks for deletion.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 405.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Live pickup and dropoff coordinates for an active job: kept with that job and dropped with the dispatch board,) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 391.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (two hours after the job's last update. Not sold or shared.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 377.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Legacy Plaid access tokens: retained until Plaid confirms the bank link is removed \(or reports it already gone\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 363.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (If Plaid cannot be reached, the token is kept and removal is retried; it is never dropped before Plaid has let go) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 349.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (of the link.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 335.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Legacy masked bank details \(institution, subtype, last four\): deleted together with the driver record.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 321.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Payment method references \(Stripe customer and payment method identifiers\): retained only while the rider) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 307.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (keeps a saved payment method. Deleted immediately on removal.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 293.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Completed trip and payout records: retained up to seven years, as required by United States tax and financial) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 279.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (record-keeping obligations, then deleted. This is the only category Curb retains on a long horizon, and it is) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 265.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (retained solely to meet a legal requirement.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 251.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- On-device data: retained until the user clears it or deletes the app. Under the user's control at all times.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 237.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Local data pool entries \(iOS and Android\): an optional, off-by-default feature that records four fields per) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 223.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (completed ride or food order - the date, a keyed tag standing for the city, whether it was a ride or an order, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 209.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (the tag version. Entries never leave the device and are never transmitted to Curb or any processor. They are) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 195.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (deleted automatically once older than 90 days, the store is capped at 2,000 entries with the oldest replaced) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 181.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (beyond that, and switching the feature off deletes every entry and destroys the device-held key that produced) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 167.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (the tags, making prior tags permanently unreadable. The pool screen also states the number of entries held) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 153.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (and the space they occupy, and carries a button that deletes every entry immediately without switching the) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 139.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (feature off. Because no copy of this data exists outside the device, deletion there is deletion everywhere.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 108.80 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (6. Deletion and disposal method) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 82.60 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Deletion is immediate and permanent rather than a soft flag. When a record is deleted:) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 60.90 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Backend records are removed from Cloudflare Durable Object storage by key deletion, which removes the) Tj
