1 0 0 1 62.11 730.00 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (value from the durable store and from subsequent reads. No shadow copy, archive table or deleted-items store) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 716.00 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (is maintained.) Tj
