1 0 0 1 56.00 646.00 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Curb maintains no offline media, no physical records and no removable storage, so physical destruction) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 632.00 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (procedures do not apply. All storage is cloud-hosted and encrypted at rest.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 601.20 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (7. Consumer rights and requests) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 575.00 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Curb honours access, deletion, correction, export and opt-out requests from consumers, including those arising) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 561.00 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (under the CCPA/CPRA and comparable state privacy laws.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 539.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Self-service. Any user can delete their Curb account from the Account screen. Deletion is refused while) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 525.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (money is still owed or a ride payment is unresolved, and the app says so. A rider can remove a saved payment) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 511.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (method from the Payment screen. Any user can clear on-device data by deleting the app, and can delete every) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 497.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (local data pool entry from the pool screen itself.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 483.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Written requests. Requests may be sent to support.curb@tkhub.app and are answered within 2 business days.) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 469.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Curb deletes everything held except records subject to the legal retention requirement in Section 5. An) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 455.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (authorised agent may submit on a consumer's behalf with written permission. No user is treated differently for) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 441.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (exercising a right.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 427.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Curb does not sell personal information, does not share it for cross-context behavioural advertising, and) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 413.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (contains no advertising, analytics or attribution SDKs.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 382.50 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (8. Security controls protecting retained data) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 356.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- All data is encrypted at rest across all storage systems.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 342.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- All data in transit is protected with TLS 1.2 or higher.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 328.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Secrets and API credentials are held in the platform secret store and are never committed to source control or) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 314.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (embedded in the mobile application.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 300.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Access to production systems is limited to the sole operator and protected by multi-factor authentication on) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 286.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (every underlying provider account.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 272.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Service-to-service authentication uses scoped API tokens rather than shared static credentials.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 258.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (- Data obtained through a legacy Plaid link is used solely to identify a driver's former payout bank. It is not used) Tj
1 0 0 1 62.11 244.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (for any secondary purpose, not enriched, not resold and not shared with third parties.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 213.50 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (9. Review) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 187.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (This policy is reviewed by the owner at least annually, and additionally before any release that changes what) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 173.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (data Curb collects, where it is stored, or how long it is kept. The review confirms that the retention limits in) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 159.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (Section 5 remain implemented in code and that no new data category has been introduced without being added) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 145.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (to this policy. The published privacy policy is updated in the same pass so that the two remain consistent.) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 114.50 Tm /F2 12.50 Tf (10. Incident handling) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 88.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (If Curb becomes aware of unauthorised access to personal data, the owner will investigate immediately, revoke) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 74.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (and rotate affected credentials, and notify affected consumers and any affected partner, including Plaid, without) Tj
1 0 0 1 56.00 60.30 Tm /F1 10.00 Tf (undue delay and in accordance with applicable law.) Tj
